        ]
       ],
       "html": "<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_exec_ara_exec_a73810.html#SWS_EM_02281\">ara::exec::ExecErrc::kOperationCanceled</a>"
      },
      {
       "tag": "td",
       "attrs": [],
       "html": "no_rollback_semantics if transition to the requested Function Group state was cancelled by a newer request. Recovery: Try again (error is informative, does not indicate a problem)"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "cells": [
      {
       "tag": "td",
       "attrs": [
        [
         "class",
         "mono"
        ]
       ],
       "html": "<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_exec_ara_exec_a73810.html#SWS_EM_02281\">ara::exec::ExecErrc::kOperationFailed</a>"
      },
      {
       "tag": "td",
       "attrs": [],
       "html": "no_rollback_semantics if transition to the requested Function Group state failed. Recovery: Try transition to another state"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "cells": [
      {
       "tag": "td",
       "attrs": [
        [
         "class",
         "mono"
        ]
       ],
       "html": "<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_exec_ara_exec_a73810.html#SWS_EM_02281\">ara::exec::ExecErrc::kNoCommunication</a>"
      },
      {
       "tag": "td",
       "attrs": [],
       "html": "no_rollback_semantics if StateClient can’t communicate with Execution Management (e.g. IPC link is down). Rovery: Try again"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "cells": [
      {
       "tag": "td",
       "attrs": [
        [
         "class",
         "mono"
        ]
       ],
       "html": "<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_exec_ara_exec_a73810.html#SWS_EM_02281\">ara::exec::ExecErrc::kInvalidTransition</a>"
      },
      {
       "tag": "td",
       "attrs": [],
       "html": "rollback_semantics if transition to the requested state is prohibited (e.g. Off state for MachineFG) or the requested Function Group State is invalid (e.g. does not exist anymore after a software update). Recovery: Eventually try transition to another state"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "cells": [
      {
       "tag": "td",
       "attrs": [
        [
         "class",
         "mono"
        ]
       ],
       "html": "<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_exec_ara_exec_a73810.html#SWS_EM_02281\">ara::exec::ExecErrc::kIntegrityOrAuthenticityCheckFailed</a>"
      },
      {
       "tag": "td",
       "attrs": [],
       "html": "no_rollback_semantics if an integrity or authenticity check failed during state transition. Recovery: transition to another state"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "cells": [
      {
       "tag": "td",
       "attrs": [
        [
         "class",
         "mono"
        ]
       ],
       "html": "<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_exec_ara_exec_a73810.html#SWS_EM_02281\">ara::exec::ExecErrc::kUnexpectedTermination</a>"
      },
      {
       "tag": "td",
       "attrs": [],
       "html": "no_rollback_semantics One of the processes terminated in an unexpected way during the state transition. Recovery: transition to another state"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "cells": [
      {
       "tag": "td",
       "attrs": [
        [
         "class",
         "mono"
        ]
       ],
       "html": "<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_exec_ara_exec_a73810.html#SWS_EM_02281\">ara::exec::ExecErrc::kInvalidMetaModelIdentifier</a>"
      },
      {
       "tag": "td",
       "attrs": [],
       "html": "rollback_semantics The given Function Group State couldn’t be found in the Processed Manifest or Process does not have a mapping to the Function Group of the requested Function Group State. Recovery: transition to another state"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"notes\"><b>Hinweise:</b> Asynchronous nature of <a class=\"vis-internal\" href=\"cl_ara_exec_StateClient_276b21.html#SWS_EM_02278\">ara::exec::StateClient::SetState</a> makes the returned ara:: core::Future dependable on lifetime of the instance from which it was received. It is expected that once state change request is received by Execution Management, it will be processed independently of lifetime of the instance from which it was requested. Please note that the qualified short names representing Function Groups and Function Group States could be quite long. They can be replaced by implementation specific data types to speed up any checks that have to be performed by the <a class=\"vis-internal\" href=\"cl_ara_exec_StateClient_276b21.html\">ara::exec::StateClient</a>:: SetState method. This is enabled by the <a class=\"vis-internal\" href=\"cl_ara_exec_FunctionGroupState_651be1.html\">ara::exec::FunctionGroupState</a> data-type.</div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  }
